\description{
Wraps \code{qgcomp::qgcomp.noboot()} or
\code{qgcomp::qgcomp.boot()} on pseudobulk data for
cell-type-specific exposure mixture analysis. Unlike
\code{\link{run_sc_mixture}} (simplified screening), it
