  Pos/neg weights \tab No \tab Yes (without bootstrap) \cr
  P-value for overall effect \tab No \tab Yes \cr
  Speed \tab Fast \tab Moderate \cr
  Minimum n \tab 5 \tab 10+ recommended \cr
}
